### Prepare Origin

1. (create_candidate origin_availability_alpha)
2. (allocate_vehicle_unit origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha)
3. (attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
4. (confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha) ; note this action takes ?candidate and ?route_task_profile
5. (assign_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
6. (activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha) ; parameters: ?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability ?origin_node - origin_node ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile
7. (lock_origin_availability origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
8. (release_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha) ; after lock we can release

Now origin is locked and confirmed.

Vehicle_unit_alpha still allocated to origin (vehicle not available). We'll keep it allocated until we dispatch origin later.

